  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_dunmer/banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"565\" height=\"148\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>丹莫</strong>家具系列，適用於<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasys-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>幻想家具</strong></a>模組，新增了功能齊全的家具，包括但不限於：<strong>儲物箱</strong>、<strong>抽屜</strong>、<strong>床</strong>、<strong>座椅</strong>等！</p><p>此家具系列的設計靈感主要來自《上古卷軸》系列中的<strong>丹莫</strong>種族，特別是其於《晨風》與《上古卷軸Online》中的造型。</p><h3>合成配方</h3><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>要合成<strong>丹莫木材</strong>/<strong>丹莫羊毛</strong>，必須輸入<strong>#minecraft:planks</strong>/<strong>#minecraft:wool</strong>。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_dunmer/stonecutter_planks.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_dunmer/stonecutter_wool.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>要合成<strong>丹莫</strong>家具方塊，必須在<strong>家具工作站</strong>中輸入<strong>#fantasyfurniture:binding_agent</strong>、<strong>丹莫木材</strong>與<strong>丹莫羊毛</strong>。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_dunmer/furniture_station.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我們的<strong>Discord</strong></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/third_party/discord_banner.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"59\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fapexstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f4d8198a-6c2a-4d86-8d74-1977589e8ef7.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
